								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14102#msg14102">And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> February 01, 2005, 02:48:47 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
