							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14110#msg14110"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14110#msg14110">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 03:44:54 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Unless DoN is just really outstanding, I expect blue servers to be merging within 3 months if not sooner.&nbsp; People continue to leave the game and the population is dropping every month.&nbsp; 
						</td>
