								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=371"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14114#msg14114"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14114#msg14114">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 04:36:49 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Zek merger was announced long ago.&nbsp; PvP servers have always been incredibly low pop, and this was a way for them to get some more excitement back into those servers.&nbsp; I&#039;ve heard nothing but good things about DoN, btw.&nbsp; Although they need to implement the barter system in the bazaar, not in a seperate zone.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
