	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14118"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=272" title="View the profile of Rednight">Rednight</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 255<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.disorder.com/eq/rednight-avatar.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Huuh...Whaat...YEAAAH~!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/mi_2_az@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="mi_2_az@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=272"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14118#msg14118"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14118#msg14118">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 05:33:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							There is no way to bring them all back, though they can try to salvage what is left.  Still think revamping older zones is teh way to go, rather then create another unfinished expansion that only high end has access to.  Someone mentioned if a new person comes to join Everquest, they would join 2 rather then 1.  I would agree, as soon as they came out with 2 I think they doomed 1.  Should of just fixed, revamped, added more fun, soloability.  I think it would be fun to have a GM event, where an entire guild can take on a GM.  Rewards would be some sort of custom specialization..I.E. Title, Armor graphic.  Maybe new Illusions, Giant, dragon...continue to fix trade skills.&nbsp; Top end Tradeskill gear/items should be 1 tier below the top high end raid content gear/items.&nbsp; Maybe 1.5/2 but somewhat closer.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: February 01, 2005, 05:36:03 pm by Rednight</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
