	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14127"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=54" title="View the profile of DepravenSoul">DepravenSoul</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 63<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=54"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:jstarret@nmsu.edu"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14127#msg14127"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14127#msg14127">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> February 01, 2005, 06:59:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I would have to disagree with you that bazaar trader population is an accurate representation of a servers health and active population. For alot of people, pp does not have much use as it once did. Clerics and necros don&#039;t have to stockpile peridots anymore, alot of people have the best tradeable gear already, and the amount of people skilling up tradeskills has decreased alot since to even be remotely successful at OoW combines, you need all those tradeskill mastery AAs and salvage. Not to mention, there are alot of characters on the server with all tradeskills maxxed already.<br /><br />The amount of entry level armor and tradeskill items such as spider silk in bazaar has decreased. Selling pp is not as profitable as it once was, and so there are less people willing to take the time to farm it just to sell. There is still alot of OoW armor being traded in bazaar, and the new augmentation market seems to be doing well, although alot of it in my opinion is overpriced.<br /><br />My overal view of the server though, is during peak raid time, and I see DA/EiE, Conviction, Reign of Swords, Union of Power, and other guilds still raiding with strong numbers. Later in the evening, there is usually 30+ people grinding in WoW and 20+ in MPG. Getting a pickup group does not seem impossible to me, and if you were in a high end guild you could still form your own group if enough members of your guild were still on after raids.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=176710" target="_blank"><br /><img src="http://web.nmsu.edu/~jstarret/DepsigFoT.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a><br />GM of all Tradeskills!!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
