							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It&#039;s not dead, but it is slowly dying. Kinda like a small pebble at the top of a mountain, further it gets down hill the bigger it gets... the faster it goes. The &quot;EQ pebble&quot; is about 75% near the end of the mountain.
