							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If bazaar numbers are your indicator, fair enough.&nbsp; There are currently 303 in the bazaar, looking at my trader atm.&nbsp; Considerably more than the 150 you listed earlier.&nbsp; Does that mean people are coming back?
